{"symbol":"ATT.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:47:20Z","info":{"address1":"ul. E. Kwiatkowskiego 8","city":"Tarnów","zip":"33-101","country":"Poland","phone":"48 14 637 37 37","fax":"48 14 633 0718","website":"https://tarnow.grupaazoty.com","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","industryKey":"agricultural-inputs","industryDisp":"Agricultural Inputs","sector":"Basic Materials","sectorKey":"basic-materials","sectorDisp":"Basic Materials","longBusinessSummary":"Grupa Azoty S.A. manufactures and sells fertilizers, plastics, and other chemicals in Poland, Germany, South America, Asia, other European Union countries, Rest of Europe, and internationally. The company operates through Plastics, Chemistry, Power Industry, Agro, and Other segments. It offers liquid foliar fertilizers, fertigation products, bio stimulants, SRF and CRF fertilizers for precise fertilization, and NPK fertilizers; multi-component fertilizers, such as Polifoski and Amofoski; DAP and PK fertilizer; nitrogen fertilizers with sulfur in solid and liquid form, including ammonium sulphate, ammonium sulphate nitrate, urea-ammonium sulphate, calcium ammonium nitrate with sulfur, urea-ammonium sulphate, and RSM, a urea-ammonium nitrate; and phosphate fertilizers, supplies ammonia, technical and concentrated nitric acid, and technical gases. The company also provides caprolactam, an intermediate product for the production of polyamide 6 (PA6); natural engineering plastics (PA6); modified plastics based on PA6; engineering plastics, such as PA66, PPC- polypropylene, PPH, and PBT- polybutylene terephthalate; plastic products, such as PA tubes, PE tubes, and polyamide casings; polypropylene; and melamine, OXO alcohols, plasticizers, sulfur, titanium white, iron sulfate, and urea and ammonia-based solutions. In addition, it is involved in generation of energy utilities; electricity, heat, water, process, and measurement air; nitrogen for chemical installations and resale; purchase and distribution of natural gas for technological purposes; materials for additive manufacturing technologies; research center; laboratory; iron-chromium catalyst, copper catalysts, and iron catalysts production; real estate rental; and other activities. The company was formerly known as Zaklady Azotowe w Tarnowie-Moscicach Spólka Akcyjna and changed its name to Grupa Azoty Spólka Akcyjna in April 2013. Grupa Azoty S.A. was incorporated in 2001 and is based in Tarnów, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":12746,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Miroslaw  Sobczyk","title":"Independent Vice-Chairman of the Supervisory Board & Secretary of the Supervisory Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":232500,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Dr. Artur  Cholody","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":268300,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Artur  Babicz","title":"Member of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":810800,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Piotr  Marciniak","title":"Member of the Supervisory Board","fiscalYear":2025,"totalPay":232500,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Marcin  Celejewski","title":"Chairman of Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Margaret  Krolak","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jacek  Podgorski","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Piotr  Szajczyk","title":"Vice President of the Management Board","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Joanna  Barnas","title":"Investor Relations Manager","fiscalYear":2025,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1767139200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"p